    {
      "id": "lyrics",
      "name": "Song lyrics",
      "type": "text",
      "body": "Morning on the river road,\nthe fog is lifting slow,\nevery window catching light\nfrom somewhere we don't know.\n\nCarry me the long way round,\npast the orchard and the mill,\nI could live a hundred years\nand never see my fill.\n\nEvening on the river road,\nthe swallows flying low,\nevery lantern on the hill\nis telling me to go.",
      "split": "stanzas",
      "markup": false,
      "operatorEditable": true
    },
